From ee5a2f288cfda1733b4f2f2b94619dc447d4d0b6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReArc Overlay <overlay@rearc.invalid>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:38:53 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 wave 18g: route local card and address save offers

Route local card/address import offers to a WebContents-owned request/response adapter. Accept, decline and ignore invoke Chromium callbacks; no full card number or CVC crosses the ABI. Preserve the submission navigation, cancel subsequent navigation and close, and ignore offers without a host callback. Account migration and cloud-save UI are not offered in registry tabs. ABI 1.37 / bridge 0.39.0 (autofill_save_prompts); p91 and native HTTPS address accept/card decline/card accept/store verification pass, with no outside connections.

Last rebased: 2026-11-04 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
